12.52,
"Good morning."
],
[
12.9,
14.02,
"This is the GitHub report."
],
[
14.7,
16.48,
"On October 31, we started hunting."
],
[
17.38,
18.44,
"One question drove it."
],
[
18.98,
29.9,
"What is out there free and open that makes this business faster, sharper, and richer?"
],
[
29.9,
31.74,
"Today you get the ones that matter most."
],
[
32.46,
32.88,
"Hold on."
],
[
33.82,
35.86,
"Before you run through these, tell me plain."
],
[
36.84,
37.78,
"What is a repository?"
],
[
39.0,
42.4,
"A repository is a public workshop where the code for a tool lives."
],
[
43.18,
44.64,
"GitHub is the shelf it sits on."
],
[
45.2,
49.44,
"When a repository is open, anyone can look inside, use it, and build on it."
],
[
49.96,
52.52,
"That is why everything on this board costs zero dollars."
],
[
53.48,
53.94,
"First, the builders."
],
[
54.64,
57.84,
"ECC leads the board at nearly 300,000 stars."
],
[
57.84,
61.44,
"It tunes your coding agents for speed, memory, and security."
],
[
62.24,
66.76,
"Claude Memme gives those agents a memory, so your rules carry from session to session"
],
[
66.76,
68.56,
"instead of starting over every morning."
],
[
69.34,
72.8,
"Anthropic's own skills collection went open source on November 6,"
],
[
73.2,
76.5,
"and its document skills feed straight into your PDF guide product."
],
[
79.88,
81.26,
"Next, the film machine."
],
[
82.0,
87.08,
