],
[
87.08,
91.78,
"It drama claw turns a script into a finished drama real mimic takes a video"
],
[
91.78,
95.88,
"you love and makes a new one in the same style and its paper cutout engine"
],
[
95.88,
105.28,
"matches your scandal style directly all right so what would this particular"
],
[
105.28,
111.2,
"repository do for my business two things straight drama claw and real mimic cut"
],
[
111.2,
116.18,
"your film pipeline to near zero script to finish drama without a crew and the"
],
[
116.18,
120.0,
